title: Make the collator protocol revamp the default implementation (on Polkadot)
doc:
- audience: Node Dev
  description: |-
    The collator protocol revamp is now the default validator side collator protocol implementation
    on all chains. Previously it was enabled by default only on Kusama. With this change Polkadot
    validators will run the revamped protocol.

    Pass `--experimental-collator-protocol=false` to the binary to use the legacy implementation.
crates:
- name: polkadot-cli
  bump: patch
- name: polkadot-collator-protocol
  bump: patch
